":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0sorkon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0sorkon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0sorkon"}},{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"<!--\r\nVerify first that your issue/request is not already reported on GitHub.\r\nAlso test if the latest release and main branch are affected too.\r\nAlways add information AFTER of these HTML comments, but no need to delete the comments.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n\r\n##### ISSUE TYPE\r\n<!-- Pick one below and delete the rest -->\r\n * Bug Report\r\n\r\n##### COMPONENT NAME\r\n<!--\r\nCategorize the issue, e.g. API, VR, VPN, UI, etc.\r\n-->\r\n~~~\r\nUI\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n##### CLOUDSTACK VERSION\r\n<!--\r\nNew line separated list of affected versions, commit ID for issues on main branch.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n~~~\r\n4.19.1.2\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n##### CONFIGURATION\r\n<!--\r\nInformation about the configuration if relevant, e.g. basic network, advanced networking, etc.  N/A otherwise\r\n-->\r\nbasic network, with security group offering\r\n\r\n##### OS / ENVIRONMENT\r\n<!--\r\nInformation about the environment if relevant, N/A otherwise\r\n-->\r\nalmalinux9, kvm\r\n\r\n##### SUMMARY\r\n<!-- Explain the problem/feature briefly -->\r\n\r\nAfter a fresh install and doing the setup wizard, the Network->Security groups UI item will not be shown until you restart\r\nthe cloudstack-management service and relog. \r\n\r\n##### STEPS TO REPRODUCE\r\n<!--\r\nFor bugs, show exactly how to reproduce the problem, using a minimal test-case. Use Screenshots if accurate.\r\n\r\nFor new features, show how the feature would be used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n<!-- Paste example playbooks or commands between quotes below -->\r\n~~~\r\nDo a fresh CloudStack install\r\nRun through the wizard with basic zone + security groups\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n<!-- You can also paste gist.github.com links for larger files -->\r\n\r\n##### EXPECTED RESULTS\r\n<!-- What did you expect to happen when running the steps above? -->\r\n\r\n~~~\r\nSecurity group entry without restarting the cloudstack-management service.\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n##### ACTUAL RESULTS\r\n<!-- What actually happened? -->\r\n\r\n<!-- Paste verbatim command output between quotes below -->\r\n~~~\r\nSecurity groups item is missing, and maybe other too?(Guest VLAN)\r\n~~~\r\n","comments":6,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/9853/comments","created_at":"2024-10-24T15:44:38Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/9853/events","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/cloudstack/issues/9853","id":2611976842,"labels":[{"color":"a5f9ff","default":false,"description":"","id":817420428,"name":"type:improvement","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4MTc0MjA0Mjg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/type:improvement"},{"color":"0960EB","default":false,"description":"","id":2630030189,"name":"component:zone-wizard","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjMwMDMwMTg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/component:zone-wizard"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/9853/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":{"closed_issues":79,"created_at":"2026-01-21T11:18:05Z","creator":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2486961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DaanHoogland","id":2486961,"login":"DaanHoogland","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0ODY5NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/repos","site_admin":false,"starr