ithub.com/repos/apache/cloudstack","state":"open","title":"Reserve IP address for out of bounds machines","type":{"color":"blue","created_at":"2024-01-25T09:11:09Z","description":"A request, idea, or new functionality","id":93574,"name":"Feature","node_id":"IT_kwDNuP_OAAFthg","updated_at":"2024-10-08T08:30:20Z"},"updated_at":"2026-08-25T06:46:30Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/4542","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39186039?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleskxyz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleskxyz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleskxyz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleskxyz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aleskxyz","id":39186039,"login":"aleskxyz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MTg2MDM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleskxyz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleskxyz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleskxyz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleskxyz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleskxyz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleskxyz"}},{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"<!--\r\nVerify first that your issue/request is not already reported on GitHub.\r\nAlso test if the latest release and main branch are affected too.\r\nAlways add information AFTER of these HTML comments, but no need to delete the comments.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n##### ISSUE TYPE\r\n<!-- Pick one below and delete the rest -->\r\n * Bug Report\r\n\r\n\r\n##### COMPONENT NAME\r\n<!--\r\nCategorize the issue, e.g. API, VR, VPN, UI, etc.\r\n-->\r\n~~~\r\nAPI, UI, logic\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n##### CLOUDSTACK VERSION\r\n<!--\r\nNew line separated list of affected versions, commit ID for issues on main branch.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n~~~\r\n4.18\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n##### CONFIGURATION\r\n<!--\r\nInformation about the configuration if relevant, e.g. basic network, advanced networking, etc.  N/A otherwise\r\n-->\r\nN/A\r\n\r\n##### OS / ENVIRONMENT\r\n<!--\r\nInformation about the environment if relevant, N/A otherwise\r\n-->\r\nKVM with Tungsten Fabric\r\n\r\n##### SUMMARY\r\n<!-- Explain the problem/feature briefly -->\r\nI want to create an isolated network with Public IPs which will be then routed with a Tungsten Logical Router.\r\n\r\n##### STEPS TO REPRODUCE\r\n<!--\r\nFor bugs, show exactly how to reproduce the problem, using a minimal test-case. Use Screenshots if accurate.\r\n\r\nFor new features, show how the feature would be used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n<!-- Paste example playbooks or commands between quotes below -->\r\n~~~\r\n-> Add Network, Isolated. In Gateway place a non-RFC1918 range.\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n<!-- You can also paste gist.github.com links for larger files -->\r\n\r\n##### EXPECTED RESULTS\r\n<!-- What did you expect to happen when running the steps above? -->\r\n\r\n~~~\r\nFor the network to be created with that range\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n##### ACTUAL RESULTS\r\n<!-- What actually happened? -->\r\n\r\n<!-- Paste verbatim command output between quotes below -->\r\n~~~\r\n\"Virtual Guest Cidr 33.65.45.0/24 is not RFC 1918 or 6598 compliant\"\r\n~~~\r\n","comments":2,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/7458/comments","created_at":"2023-04-24T13:04:04Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/7458/events","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/cloudstack/issues/7458","id":1681234383,"labels":[{"color":"F313C4","default":false,"description":"","id":5426531036,"name":"component:tungsten-fabric","node_id":"LA_kwDOAJTq2M8AAAABQ3JK3A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/component:tungsten-fabric"},{"color":"E43179","default":false,"description":"","id":6890295339,"name":"status:stale","node_id":"LA_kwDOAJTq2M8AAAABmrGQKw","url":"https:/